B.KE=s(["New Daily Mode - everybody gets the same set of songs!","Powers that are available for the Daily mode are Bazinga, Mana, SFTS, Crimzone, and What.","Bumped up version (1.8.0) to accommodate the new Daily mode."],t.s)
B.Ez=new A.nr("v1.8.0","Current release",B.KE)
B.M2=s(["Performance improvements and bug fixes.","Added Pablo's cats to help tap songs and enemies","Added a longer version of the Mana song inspired by the movie Forgotten Island."],t.s)
B.EA=new A.nr("v1.7.7","Previous release",B.M2)
B.Ms=s(["Added negative combo multiplier.","Added Crab Scores tab for the negative scores leaderboard.","Added Hall of Famer tab for previous relases top scorers.","Modified Leaderboard to show up to 20 entries","Fixed Gameover screen not showing negative scores","Leaderboard reset.","Fixed audio powers not resuming after a mute and consequentially buggin the powers.","Loaded audio should now play on cue at first play.","Added new Jayat sprite to counter the negative combo multiplier.","Jayat has a flat value of 10. He can spawn from SB19 Stell sprites."],t.s)
B.EB=new A.nr("v1.7.6","Previous release",B.Ms)
B.LC=s(["Ported the game to a simple game engine for better performance and future-proofing.","Enhanced graphics and effects, including new scanline shader.","Added Settings overlay with audio, haptics, and graphics options.","Added mute button to main menu and pause overlay.","Added a combo system: consecutive crab hits build a multiplier up to x5, hitting the wrong target or letting the chain time out breaks it.","Added a changelog and power info overlay to the About screen.","Added a disclaimer overlay to the About screen.","Ported powers: Bazinga, Mana, Timer Pause, Gento, 8 Ton Ball, Wyat, What, SFTS, Crimzone, WMIAN, and Quit.","Modified the scoring system to accommodate the new combo system and powers.","Modified some power mechanics and scoring values for better balance and game feel.","Added new visual effects for some poowers and scoring events."],t.s)
B.Ey=new A.nr("v1.7.5","Previous release",B.LC)
B.MJ=s(["Initial release of Dungka the Game made with javascript"],t.s)
B.Ex=new A.nr("v1.0.0","Previous release",B.MJ)
B.KN=s([B.Ez,B.EA,B.EB,B.Ey,B.Ex],A.aa("A<nr>"))
B.Sh=new A.ht("BAZINGA","bazinga","One clean sweep and everything on screen goes with it. Say it like you mean it.","Common")
B.Sc=new A.ht("MANA","mana","A blessing straight to your countdown. Take the gift, keep both feet on the ground and never forget.","Uncommon")
B.Sd=new A.ht("TIMER PAUSE","timerpause","Buys you a moment that shouldn't exist. The clock stops, but only for you.","Uncommon")
B.Sb=new A.ht("GENTO","gento","Everything it touches turns to gold. Doesn't last forever, so move fast.","Uncommon")
B.Sj=new A.ht("8TONBALL","8tonball","Let something heavier do the work for a while. It doesn't ask twice, and it doesn't miss.","Rare")
B.Si=new A.ht("WYAT","wyat","Keeps asking the same question. Answer right and it pays out, answer wrong and it costs you.","Rare")
B.Sf=new A.ht("WHAT","what","Confusion has a color scheme, and it's already been memorized. You'll figure it out. Maybe.","Rare")
B.Sg=new A.ht("SFTS","sfts","Reach for the stars. Just make sure you're shooting at the right one.","Rare")
B.Sl=new A.ht("CRIMZONE","crimzone","Not everything in the red zone is worth the same. Distance has a price.","Rare")
B.Se=new A.ht("WMIAN","wmian","Don't forrow your eyebrows. They're all coming to you now, big and small alike.","Legendary")
B.Sk=new A.ht("QUIT","quit","You don't get to hear this one until you've already proven your worth. It's a one-time deal, so make it count.","Mythic")
B.KP=s([B.Sh,B.Sc,B.Sd,B.Sb,B.Sj,B.Si,B.Sf,B.Sg,B.Sl,B.Se,B.Sk],A.aa("A<ht>"))
